    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Les nuits sans lune, il quadrille le ciel à la recherche d’une proie. Dans l’obscurité, aucun Pokémon ne peut rivaliser avec lui.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "x",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "They fly around on moonless nights and attack careless prey. Nothing can beat them in a battle in the dark.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "x",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "月明かりすら　ない　闇夜を　飛び 油断している　獲物を　襲う。 暗闇の　戦いでは　無敵だ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "x",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il peut littéralement pulvériser de gros rochers grâce aux ultrasons émis par ses oreilles. Il surgit des ténèbres pour attaquer par surprise.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "y",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/24/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "The ultrasonic waves it emits from its ears can reduce a large boulder to pebbles. It swoops out of the dark to attack.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "y",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/24/"
        }
      },
      {
